 Returns the reactivated webhook in the response body.
 
+## Event deliveries
+
+Each new board event whose action is selected by an active webhook is sent to its payload URL in a `POST`. For regular URLs, the body is the JSON event payload and `X-Webhook-Signature` contains the hexadecimal HMAC-SHA256 of the exact request body, using the webhook's signing secret. The `X-Webhook-Timestamp` header contains the event's creation time.
+
+Fizzy creates one delivery per webhook/event pair and makes one delivery attempt; failed requests are logged but not retried. Receivers can use the event `id` to deduplicate. A webhook is deactivated after ten consecutive failures within one hour. Delivery history is retained for one week.
+
 ## `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/webhooks/:webhook_id/deliveries`
 
 Returns a paginated list of deliveries for a webhook. Only account admins can access delivery history.
diff --git a/test/models/event_webhook_test.rb b/test/models/event_webhook_test.rb
